  "body": "## Summary\n\nDesign record for issue #6046: the Atlas golden-set builder + eval gate.\n\n- **Golden-set schema and versioning** — the data format feeding the landed atlas-eval/v1 harness (issue #5741 / PR #6262): queries, qrels, runs.\n- **Promotion flow** — how negative feedback (thumbs-down) and sampled live queries from parent issue #6027 are promoted into verified eval entries through human or agent confirmation.\n- **Eval-gate contract** — which change classes must run the gate, which metrics are evaluated (nDCG@10, Recall@100, MRR@10), and the exact regression deltas that block a merge.\n- **Maintenance lifecycle** — detecting, repairing, or retiring stale queries and vanishing chunk references as the corpus mutates.\n\nDesign only — no implementation in this PR. Produced under queue task 13056 (branch pushed by the previous holder at 11c0128c00; PR opened by lane code-t on resume after the secondary rate limit that blocked the original PR creation).\n\nCloses #6046",
